  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 758992,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 10 out of 10 - Maths Number: Commodore Amiga Description\n\nEmbark on a vibrant and engaging mathematical adventure with *10 out of 10 - Maths Number* for the Commodore Amiga! This charming educational game is specifically designed for children, transforming learning about numbers into a fun and rewarding experience. \n\nThe game presents a series of progressively challenging puzzles and exercises centered around fundamental mathematical concepts. Players will encounter colorful graphics and a playful interface as they tackle addition, subtraction, multiplication, and division problems.  Each successful completion unlocks new levels and rewards, encouraging continued learning and building confidence. \n\n*10 out of 10 - Maths Number* isn't just about rote memorization; it fosters problem-solving skills and a genuine understanding of numerical relationships.  Perfect for young learners, this title provides a delightful and effective way to build a strong foundation in mathematics, making learning an enjoyable and interactive journey.  Prepare for a rewarding experience that will leave children feeling empowered and excited about numbers!"
    },
